   "seed": 1001108723,
   "text": "Reading order: the Overview band defines the navigation shell and the module map. Each module band then runs desktop screens left\u2192right, with its mobile screens beneath.\nCorrected data model throughout \u2014 see specs/review/01-spec-review.md and 02-decisions.md.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
