  {
   "id": "V7YnxxdQ09MS98-eQ7n3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1504,
   "y": 588.0,
   "width": 460,
   "height": 300.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "a0",
   "roundness": null,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 352826018,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789320956557,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "seed": 873825319,
   "text": "1.  Groups are intent-based, not table-based:\n        MAIN \u00b7 OPERATIONS \u00b7 MONEY \u00b7 INSIGHT \u00b7 SYSTEM\n\n2.  Active item: teal pill, white icon + label.\n        Sub-navigation expands only under the active item.\n\n3.  Badges are counts that need action today\n        (open orders, due returns) \u2014 never vanity metrics.\n\n4.  Branch switcher and user block are pinned to the\n        bottom; switching branch re-scopes every list.\n\n5.  In RTL (Dari / Pashto) the whole rail mirrors to the\n        right edge and chevrons flip.\n\n6.  Collapsed rail keeps icons only; labels appear as\n        tooltips. State persists per user.\n\n7.  Items the user lacks permission for are hidden,\n        not disabled.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1.  Groups are intent-based, not table-based:\n        MAIN \u00b7 OPERATIONS \u00b7 MONEY \u00b7 INSIGHT \u00b7 SYSTEM\n\n2.  Active item: teal pill, white icon + label.\n        Sub-navigation expands only under the active item.\n\n3.  Badges are counts that need action today\n        (open orders, due returns) \u2014 never vanity metrics.\n\n4.  Branch switcher and user block are pinned to the\n        bottom; switching branch re-scopes every list.\n\n5.  In RTL (Dari / Pashto) the whole rail mirrors to the\n        right edge and chevrons flip.\n\n6.  Collapsed rail keeps icons only; labels appear as\n        tooltips. State persists per user.\n\n7.  Items the user lacks permission for are hidden,\n        not disabled.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
