   "seed": 249653105,
   "text": "Reads inventory_items joined to inventory_stock_balances (view). Lifecycle column = inventory_items.lifecycle_status (active / repairing / discontinued / disposed) \u2014 a STORED value.\nOn hand, On rent and Avg cost come from the ledger roll-up; Rsvd comes from inventory_reservations (status=active). Avail = on hand \u2212 reserved, Worth = (on hand + on rent) \u00d7 avg cost (WAC).\nAvailability (available / reserved / rented / out of stock) is never stored \u2014 it is derived per row at read time.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Reads inventory_items joined to inventory_stock_balances (view). Lifecycle column = inventory_items.lifecycle_status (active / repairing / discontinued / disposed) \u2014 a STORED value.\nOn hand, On rent and Avg cost come from the ledger roll-up; Rsvd comes from inventory_reservations (status=active). Avail = on hand \u2212 reserved, Worth = (on hand + on rent) \u00d7 avg cost (WAC).\nAvailability (available / reserved / rented / out of stock) is never stored \u2014 it is derived per row at read time.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
