   "seed": 133254498,
   "text": "Read-only. inventory_stock_transactions is append-only and immutable \u2014 no row is ever edited or deleted.\nTypes: stock_in \u00b7 stock_out \u00b7 adjustment \u00b7 transfer_in \u00b7 transfer_out \u00b7 rent_out \u00b7 rent_return \u00b7 dispose.  There is NO reserve / release type \u2014 reservations are not stock movements.\nunit_cost on a stock_in is the landed cost from the source document; on a stock_out it is the weighted-average cost snapshotted at posting time.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Read-only. inventory_stock_transactions is append-only and immutable \u2014 no row is ever edited or deleted.\nTypes: stock_in \u00b7 stock_out \u00b7 adjustment \u00b7 transfer_in \u00b7 transfer_out \u00b7 rent_out \u00b7 rent_return \u00b7 dispose.  There is NO reserve / release type \u2014 reservations are not stock movements.\nunit_cost on a stock_in is the landed cost from the source document; on a stock_out it is the weighted-average cost snapshotted at posting time.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
