   "updated": 1789320956557,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "seed": 326994227,
   "text": "Draft writes inventory_stock_entries + inventory_stock_entry_items only \u2014 no stock moves yet.\nPOST writes one inventory_stock_transactions row per line (type=stock_in, reference_type=inventory_stock_entry)\nand recomputes the weighted average cost in inventory_stock_balances:\n   new_avg = (on_hand \u00d7 avg + qty_in \u00d7 unit_cost) / (on_hand + qty_in)\nThe 'New avg cost' column previews that result before you commit. After posting the entry is immutable \u2014 correct it by Void.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Draft writes inventory_stock_entries + inventory_stock_entry_items only \u2014 no stock moves yet.\nPOST writes one inventory_stock_transactions row per line (type=stock_in, reference_type=inventory_stock_entry)\nand recomputes the weighted average cost in inventory_stock_balances:\n   new_avg = (on_hand \u00d7 avg + qty_in \u00d7 unit_cost) / (on_hand + qty_in)\nThe 'New avg cost' column previews that result before you commit. After posting the entry is immutable \u2014 correct it by Void.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
