   "seed": 1618240926,
   "text": "READS sales_orders + derived columns. Type badge = DERIVED order_kind from sales_order_items.line_type\n(all sale \u2192 Sale \u00b7 all rental \u2192 Rental \u00b7 both \u2192 Mixed). The header never contradicts its lines.\nDeposit held column = \u03a3 finance_customer_deposits WHERE sales_order_id = order AND status='held' \u2014 shown\nSEPARATELY from Paid, because a deposit is not payment toward the total. Balance is a display value\nrecomputed from payments; the authoritative A/R row lives in finance_receivables.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "READS sales_orders + derived columns. Type badge = DERIVED order_kind from sales_order_items.line_type\n(all sale \u2192 Sale \u00b7 all rental \u2192 Rental \u00b7 both \u2192 Mixed). The header never contradicts its lines.\nDeposit held column = \u03a3 finance_customer_deposits WHERE sales_order_id = order AND status='held' \u2014 shown\nSEPARATELY from Paid, because a deposit is not payment toward the total. Balance is a display value\nrecomputed from payments; the authoritative A/R row lives in finance_receivables.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
