   "seed": 468720794,
   "text": "WRITES sales_rental_claims (claim_type \u2208 damage | loss | late, charge_amount, deposit_applied,\nbalance_to_ar, sales_order_id, sales_order_item_id) \u2014 a document in its own right, NOT sales_sale_returns.\nfinance_customer_deposits 6,000 \u2192 status='applied' (liability cleared, not income).\nRemaining 26,000 \u2192 finance_receivables (open). Charge \u2192 finance_transactions Income.\nFor claim_type='loss': linked inventory_disposals row + inventory_stock_transactions type='disposal'.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "WRITES sales_rental_claims (claim_type \u2208 damage | loss | late, charge_amount, deposit_applied,\nbalance_to_ar, sales_order_id, sales_order_item_id) \u2014 a document in its own right, NOT sales_sale_returns.\nfinance_customer_deposits 6,000 \u2192 status='applied' (liability cleared, not income).\nRemaining 26,000 \u2192 finance_receivables (open). Charge \u2192 finance_transactions Income.\nFor claim_type='loss': linked inventory_disposals row + inventory_stock_transactions type='disposal'.",
