   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789320956557,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "seed": 2000744572,
   "text": "READS sales_order_items JOIN sales_orders over the period, split by line_type \u2014 this is why line_type\nmust be authoritative: a mixed order contributes to BOTH the sale and the rental column.\nRevenue EXCLUDES deposits entirely (finance_customer_deposits is a liability) and excludes refunds.\nSale COGS = \u03a3 qty \u00d7 unit_cost_snapshot. Rental cost = per-use amortisation (purchase_cost \u00f7 expected_uses),\nso a 40,000 AFN gown is expensed gradually instead of on its first rental or never.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "READS sales_order_items JOIN sales_orders over the period, split by line_type \u2014 this is why line_type\nmust be authoritative: a mixed order contributes to BOTH the sale and the rental column.\nRevenue EXCLUDES deposits entirely (finance_customer_deposits is a liability) and excludes refunds.\nSale COGS = \u03a3 qty \u00d7 unit_cost_snapshot. Rental cost = per-use amortisation (purchase_cost \u00f7 expected_uses),\nso a 40,000 AFN gown is expensed gradually instead of on its first rental or never.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
