   "text": "Oldest-first allocation is the default and is editable.\nPOST writes one finance_transactions IN, reduces each\nallocated finance_receivables row, and refreshes the\ncached balance on the linked sales_orders.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
