   "seed": 1421457661,
   "text": "held = taken \u2212 applied \u2212 forfeited \u2212 refunded, and the TOTALS row reconciles exactly to the\n'Deposits held' tile on the dashboard and to the cash split on the Cash & banks screen.\nRow 5 is a damage case: 12,000 of a 20,000 deposit was forfeited (\u2192 INCOME, appears in the\nP&L as 'forfeited deposits') and 8,000 was applied to the final rental balance.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "held = taken \u2212 applied \u2212 forfeited \u2212 refunded, and the TOTALS row reconciles exactly to the\n'Deposits held' tile on the dashboard and to the cash split on the Cash & banks screen.\nRow 5 is a damage case: 12,000 of a 20,000 deposit was forfeited (\u2192 INCOME, appears in the\nP&L as 'forfeited deposits') and 8,000 was applied to the final rental balance.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
